After installing this .pkg:

If installed for everyone:
    INSTALL_PATH="/Applications"
If installed for only yourself:
    INSTALL_PATH="${HOME}/Applications"

export PATH="${INSTALL_PATH}/bin:${PATH}"
export DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH="${INSTALL_PATH}/lib:${DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH}"

If user facing scripts (gufi_find, gufi_ls, etc.) are required,

    create ${INSTALL_PATH}/etc/config from ${INSTALL_PATH}/etc/config.example and modify it

Then,

    export PYTHONPATH="${INSTALL_PATH}/lib:${PYTHONPATH}"

or move

    ${INSTALL_PATH}/lib/gufi_common.py
    ${INSTALL_PATH}/lib/gufi_config.py

to another directory and add that directory to PYTHONPATH
